# The built adapter and admin tab are committed, so the adapter can be installed from GitHub.
# Their source maps are only needed for debugging. They contain the sources with their line endings,
# so they differ between Windows and Linux builds, and the admin ones are too large for the repository.
build/**/*.map
admin/build/*.map

